#: ui/DiagPage.qml:66
msgctxt "doctor verdict"
msgid "the pairing is refused or missing: run `akmctl repair`"
msgstr "페어링이 거부되었거나 없습니다: `akmctl repair`를 실행하십시오"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:67
msgctxt "doctor verdict"
msgid "no usable pairing: run `akmctl repair`"
msgstr "사용 가능한 페어링이 없습니다: `akmctl repair`를 실행하십시오"

#. i18n: %1 = the doctor topics to check, comma-separated
#: ui/DiagPage.qml:69
msgctxt "doctor verdict"
msgid "Link up; to check: %1 (akmctl doctor)"
msgstr "연결됨. 확인 필요: %1 (akmctl doctor)"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:70
msgctxt "doctor verdict"
msgid "link up and configuration sound"
msgstr "연결됨, 구성 정상"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:71
msgctxt "doctor verdict"
msgid ""
"keyboard not connected: press a key and wait 10 s; the service pages it on "
"its own. Pair it again only if `akmctl doctor` reports auth-failed"
msgstr ""
"키보드가 연결되지 않음: 키를 누르고 10초 기다리십시오. 서비스가 스스로 호출합"
"니다. `akmctl doctor`가 auth-failed를 보고할 때만 다시 페어링하십시오"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:78
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "rssi-helper executable, capability cap_net_admin present"
msgstr "rssi-helper 실행 가능, capability cap_net_admin 있음"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:79
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "the rssi-helper utility is not installed"
msgstr "rssi-helper 유틸리티가 설치되어 있지 않습니다"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:80
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "the rssi-helper utility failed (missing capability, Bluetooth refused)"
msgstr "rssi-helper 유틸리티가 실패했습니다(capability 없음, Bluetooth 거부)"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:81
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "the rssi-helper utility does not answer in time"
msgstr "rssi-helper 유틸리티가 제때 응답하지 않습니다"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:82
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "the Bluetooth adapter gives no measure for this link"
msgstr "Bluetooth 어댑터가 이 연결의 측정값을 제공하지 않습니다"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:83
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "the signal cannot be measured"
msgstr "신호를 측정할 수 없습니다"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:84
msgctxt "doctor finding, %1 = settings"
msgid "ignored by bluetoothd: %1"
msgstr "bluetoothd가 무시함: %1"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:85
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "[Policy] Reconnect* in place"
msgstr "[Policy] Reconnect* 설정됨"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:86
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "FastConnectable = true"
msgstr "FastConnectable = true"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:87
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid ""
"FastConnectable off: slower answer to the keyboard's page after a key press"
msgstr "FastConnectable 꺼짐: 키를 누른 뒤 키보드 호출에 대한 응답이 느려짐"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:88
msgctxt "doctor finding, %1 = file, %2 = error"
msgid "%1: %2"
msgstr "%1: %2"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:89
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "NoPollBatteries = true (no 30 s HID polling)"
msgstr "NoPollBatteries = true(30초마다 HID 폴링 안 함)"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:90
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid ""
"UPower reads the keyboard battery every 30 s (2 GET_REPORT over the air): "
"the keyboard never sleeps"
msgstr ""
"UPower가 30초마다 키보드 배터리를 읽습니다(무선으로 GET_REPORT 2회). 키보드"
"가 절전 모드로 들어가지 않습니다"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:91
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "adapter is not on USB (or not found)"
msgstr "어댑터가 USB에 있지 않음(또는 찾을 수 없음)"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:92
msgctxt "doctor finding, %1 = USB id"
msgid "%1 autosuspend off (power/control=on)"
msgstr "%1 USB 자동 일시 중단 꺼짐(power/control=on)"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:94
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid ""
"%1 USB autosuspend active (control=%2, delay %3 ms, now %4, %5 s suspended "
"since boot)"
msgstr ""
"%1 USB 자동 일시 중단 켜짐(control=%2, 지연 %3 ms, 현재 %4, 부팅 이후 %5초 일"
"시 중단)"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:95
msgctxt "doctor finding, appended"
msgid "; rule installed but not applied yet"
msgstr "; 규칙이 설치되었지만 아직 적용되지 않음"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:96
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "btusb enable_autosuspend = %1"
msgstr "btusb enable_autosuspend = %1"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:97
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "Bluetooth adapter powered"
msgstr "Bluetooth 어댑터 켜짐"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:98
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "Bluetooth adapter off"
msgstr "Bluetooth 어댑터 꺼짐"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:99
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "BlueZ unreachable (bluetooth.service stopped?)"
msgstr "BlueZ에 연결할 수 없음(bluetooth.service 중지됨?)"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:100
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "no paired Apple keyboard known to BlueZ"
msgstr "BlueZ가 알고 있는 페어링된 Apple 키보드가 없음"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:101
msgctxt "doctor finding, %1 = address"
msgid "%1 is not paired"
msgstr "%1이(가) 페어링되지 않음"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:103
msgctxt "doctor finding, %1 = address, %2 = name"
msgid "%1 “%2” paired"
msgstr "%1 “%2” 페어링됨"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:104
msgctxt "doctor finding, appended"
msgid ", bonded"
msgstr ", 본딩됨"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:105
msgctxt "doctor finding, appended"
msgid ", legacy PIN pairing"
msgstr ", 이전 방식 PIN 페어링"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:106
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "not trusted: BlueZ may refuse the keyboard's own reconnection"
msgstr "신뢰하지 않음: BlueZ가 키보드 쪽에서의 다시 연결을 거부할 수 있음"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:107
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "blocked in BlueZ"
msgstr "BlueZ에서 차단됨"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:108
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "connected"
msgstr "연결됨"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:109
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "not connected (asleep? press a key)"
msgstr "연결되지 않음(절전 중? 키를 누르십시오)"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:110
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "link key not checked (needs root: sudo akmctl doctor)"
msgstr "링크 키를 확인하지 않음(root 필요: sudo akmctl doctor)"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:111
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "no [LinkKey] stored for the keyboard"
msgstr "키보드의 [LinkKey]가 저장되어 있지 않음"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:112
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "stored key == kernel key (fingerprint %1)"
msgstr "저장된 키 == 커널 키(지문 %1)"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:113
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "stored key %1 != kernel key %2: will change at next restart"
msgstr "저장된 키 %1 != 커널 키 %2: 다음 재시작 시 바뀜"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:114
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid "stored key %1; kernel copy not readable (debugfs not mounted?)"
msgstr "저장된 키 %1; 커널 사본을 읽을 수 없음(debugfs가 마운트되지 않음?)"

#: ui/DiagPage.qml:116
msgctxt "doctor finding"
msgid ""
"link quality: %1 disconnection in the last hour, %2 in 24 h, %3 in 7 days"
msgid_plural ""
